  "changes": [
    "HuC browser waits for complete host acknowledgement after the native preset becomes visible; a delayed acknowledgement unit test preserves the functional selection contract.",
    "DMG compares each mask Live snapshot with an independently rendered timeline at exactly its own consumed source frame, preserving all16 mask PCM comparisons and source-register checks.",
    "HuC SDK test expectations include native/include and all four opaque state exports, matching the pinned recipe.",
    "Runtime staging comparison ignores only website v cache tokens; behavior mutations, module targets and non-cache queries still differ.",
    "SPU initial authored headings are selected within their three tabpanels; the additional PSF channel section is independently asserted hidden.",
    "A separately pinned UI-only controls receipt reconstructs the exact earlier reviewed source and original measured body. Historical receipt01 and all four measured reports remain unchanged; future source mutations still require review or remeasurement.",
    "Independent SID core/player/RSID builders are outside the stubbed SDK-wrapper fixture. SID workflow source/ZIP checker calls use their existing key=value CLI syntax.",
    "Analyzer package includes eight missing RF5C164/VAB/SPU-table/SID JS dependencies, both SID model artifacts and corresponding source/license kits. Strict dependency validation remains enabled, including source-kit relative references.",
    "npm DX7 and HuC browser checkers intercept every physical destination behind gain0 and assert mute state while keeping real PCM monitor branches. Product audio runtime and mixer defaults are unchanged."
  ],
